sequenceDiagram
    participant JS as Main JS Mail DOM
    participant W as Rust/WASM worker
    participant H as Native web host
    participant MC as MC runner
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant GPU as GPU worker
    participant Model as Local 120B adapter
    JS->>W: Typed Send / Reply
    W->>H: MailSend effect
    Note over H: Session / origin / CSRF
    H->>MC: Private Mail DTO
    Note over MC: Count full Harmony prompt
    Note over MC,DB: Reject oversized / stale input
    MC->>DB: Commit message + run
    MC-->>W: 202 via native host
    W-->>JS: Queued view
    Note over JS,DB: Accepted work survives page close
    DB-->>GPU: Empty wake-up
    GPU->>DB: Scan + claim ready model
    DB-->>GPU: Replay + profile + lease
    GPU->>Model: Check profile; generate
    Note over GPU,Model: Prefix cache is in-memory
    GPU->>DB: Renew current lease
    Model-->>GPU: Reply / length / failure
    GPU->>DB: Publish current attempt
    DB-->>MC: Result wake-up
    MC->>DB: Commit reply + recall state
    Note over MC,DB: Archive below useful follow-up budget
    W->>H: Scheduled Mail read
    H->>MC: Authorized page request
    MC->>DB: Read saved page
    MC-->>W: Result via native host
    W-->>JS: Reader / read-only archive
